# Pure core packages
- These packages are PURE: no network, no db, no framework imports. Keep them that way. Apps and
  adapters depend on them, never the reverse.
- Test-first: write the failing Vitest cases from the phase acceptance criteria in docs/build-plan.md,
  then implement until green.
- Do NOT begin Phase 6+ (OAuth / integrations) until Phases 1–4 pass with green tests.

# rules engine specifics
- Every rule decision MUST emit an explanation trace. No implicit conflict resolution.
- Precedence is explicit: User → Group → Dept/Office → Org default, with manual ordering in a level.
- Any change must keep the simulator explanation-trace tests passing.

# compiler specifics
- Output must be deterministic: same input → byte-identical HTML.
